<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Patch>

  <!-- ====================================================================
       GATE THE GLITTERTECH QUESTS TO LATE GAME

       Ushanka ships these for a normal colony that starts industrial:

           USH_GlittertechOutpost   rootEarliestDay 45, rootMinPoints 1000
           USH_GlittertechFacility  rootEarliestDay 60, rootMinPoints 1000

       In a run that spends its first several years in the neolithic era,
       1000 threat points arrives long before you have any business fighting
       Ultra-tech custodians, and day 45 is absurd.

       Both levers are raised. rootMinPoints is the more reliable of the two
       since it tracks colony strength rather than the calendar, but days act
       as a floor for a colony that snowballs wealth early - which, with two
       archonians on the roster, yours will.

       These are the first numbers to revisit after real playtesting. If the
       glitterheart hunt opens too late, lower rootMinPoints before touching
       rootEarliestDay.

       A harder tech gate is available if we want it: adding a VEF
       QuestChainExtension with requiredResearch = TB_IndustrialTheory would
       key these to actually tiering up rather than to accumulated strength.
       Deliberately not done here, because that also moves the quests out of
       the storyteller and into VEF's scheduler, which is a behaviour change
       worth testing on its own rather than smuggling in alongside a faction.
       ==================================================================== -->

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>Ushankas Glittertech Expansion</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationSequence">
      <operations>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/QuestScriptDef[defName="USH_GlittertechOutpost"]/rootEarliestDay</xpath>
          <value>
            <rootEarliestDay>1200</rootEarliestDay>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/QuestScriptDef[defName="USH_GlittertechOutpost"]/rootMinPoints</xpath>
          <value>
            <rootMinPoints>5000</rootMinPoints>
          </value>
        </li>

        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/QuestScriptDef[defName="USH_GlittertechFacility"]/rootEarliestDay</xpath>
          <value>
            <rootEarliestDay>1400</rootEarliestDay>
          </value>
        </li>
        <li Class="PatchOperationReplace">
          <xpath>/Defs/QuestScriptDef[defName="USH_GlittertechFacility"]/rootMinPoints</xpath>
          <value>
            <rootMinPoints>6000</rootMinPoints>
          </value>
        </li>

      </operations>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
